silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_02_concrete_anchor_6#eventbatchmicrochip silm:hasLongDescription "The EventBatchMicrochip is the candidate batch admitted at the 2026-04-19 microchip read. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'E', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
